# 1. Purpose

## Purpose Statement

The purpose of the Objective Governance document is to establish the governing framework for the creation, identification, classification, management, traceability, review, approval, modification, versioning, and retirement of all System Objectives within the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture (AVIA).

This document ensures that every System Objective is managed in a consistent, traceable, and solution-independent manner throughout its engineering lifecycle.

By defining a common governance framework, this document promotes engineering consistency, preserves objective integrity, supports controlled evolution of the objective library, and maintains alignment with the System Objective Specification (SOS) and the overall engineering philosophy of the AVIA project.

This document serves as the authoritative governance reference for all objective category documents contained within the Objectives subdomain.
